{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_52801","headline":"送贺秘监归会稽诗 · 齐澣","name":"送贺秘监归会稽诗","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"君家在四明，崇道复遗荣。\n霓服辞丹禁，天文诏玉京。\n义方延永锡，真籙受长生。\n举手都门外，白云江上行。\n（见《会稽掇英总集》卷二）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"齐澣","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_52801.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_52801","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}